# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): each drone's sub wave (SEL + its Osc mix knob on Sub · Drive,
# 2026-10-28): the sub mixed in on both drones, then drone I's and drone II's subs through Sine, Triangle and Saw (each
# as loud as the square); the swaps glide (no click). The page at rest, and with SEL turning drone II's. Not a test of
# its own (no expectations).
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
set 5 55
set 26 55
wait 2000
shot sub-rest.png
wav sub-wave.wav
wait 4000
press SEL
spin K1 1
spin K3 1
wait 4000
spin K1 1
spin K3 1
wait 300
shot sub-sel.png
wait 3700
spin K1 1
spin K3 1
wait 4000
release SEL
